# Seven-String Guitar and Plain Packages (rearmed-mods, after rs7string by SomeeName, MIT): their callbacks
# on the Mac game. NAME ADDRESS (TYPE value@LOCATION, ...) [-> CONT=ADDRESS, ...] (tools/targets/README.md).

# colours
seven_cminit   0x1006e8cec (void *manager@rbx)  # CMINIT
seven_cmbuild  0x1006eabbb (void *manager@r14)  # CMBUILD
seven_cmuv     none the build stores a single-V kind's value itself; the edits CMUV* widen those stores to columns 6 and 7
seven_cmix     none kind 14's six stores are inlined in the build and moved by edits; columns 6 and 7 are set by the publish at seven_cmbuild
seven_cmfall   none no per-string 0xRRGGBB function: the chord diagram's two six-loops (0x1007d67d0, 0x1007d6a70) read GetColour, which the edits widen

