seven_pubcl_base  0x10010f721  (int fret@rax, uint32_t string@rdx) -> done=0x10010f726  # PUBCL (PubBaseG) 0x10010f630's near-note fret, the call of 0x10010cea0 (MIDI - the six-entry base; eax = the note by PUBCLB): strings 6/7 subtract their base
